E3F3                             ;   n = 0: wait for a key
E3F3                             ;   n < 0: read a line of at most -n characters, with echo. n is not
E3F3                             ;          checked: the buffer holds 127 characters and the CR, so a
E3F3                             ;          program must ask for 127 or fewer.
